/-!
# Two movers, frozen readings [2, 3, 4], one mover at or below 2: a lonely instant for ALL such pairs (GENERATED by `s2below_gen_v1.py`)

Written 2026-10-23.  New file.  Lonely pieces of the frozen set in one lap (period 1, exact): [1/16, 7/32], [9/32, 7/24], [3/8, 7/16], [9/16, 5/8], [17/24, 23/32], [25/32, 15/16].
