  point `1/8`; `d2 < 2` within `d1/2` of an integer `j ∈ [1, 2]` by `small_I_pos` / `small_I_neg` at a frozen-clear point `τ0` with `j τ0` in the window (patterns below).
  Patterns (j, sign: τ0, N): (1,+: 1/6, 0); (1,-: 5/6, 0); (2,+: 1/6, 0); (2,-: 1/6, 0).
* `col234_<i>` (`1/8 ≤ d1 ≤ 2`): finite box cover of `{d1 ≤ d2}`, `4` columns in `d1`, `11` boxes, kinds {'P': 7, 'R1a': 4}, pieces up to lap 1 (lap-shifted copies of the frozen pieces;
  `ex_of_piece`).  [PROVISIONAL: covering]; `r1_rect` is [PROVISIONAL: counting tool].
* `exists_below_234`: for ALL `0 < d1 ≤ 2`, `d1 ≤ d2`: `∃ t > 0, FClear F t ∧ Clear2 d1 d2 t`.
Grades: [L]; `small_II` (run lemma) and `small_A` are [PROVISIONAL: counting tool].  The cascade landing follows by `landing_of_ex` (`S2Below_All`).
-/

